completed_at: "2026-08-23T22:48:46.718Z"
author: maintainer-agent
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: All file-reading flags across commands accept '-' to read stdin (inventory taken from contracts); behavior documented in the scripting contract (pm-psy1); error message for unreadable paths mentions the '-' option; tests cover piped heredoc usage; no behavior change for real paths
parent: pm-mpbb
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: External-content file flags now share stdin-token resolution while preserving filesystem behavior and structured recovery.
expected_result: Every scoped --*-file flag accepts '-' for piped content without changing real-path reads.
actual_result: "Body, comment, note, and learning file inputs accept stdin through the common resolver and publish truthful invocation modes."
